49, 1498], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1476.0], [648.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——休假\n\n## 主题释义：\n\n从生存走向生活，用合理的时间休假，实现更加轻松自由的生活！休假不仅仅是在外出旅途中领悟自然的魅力和世界的美好、回归真实的自己和生命的本质，也是在不违背法律和影响别人的基础上，一切让自己感受到放松、愉悦、舒服、消遣的方式，怎么轻松、怎么自由怎么来！\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[84]</div>\n\n\n## 考评奖励标准——休假\n\n## 标准等级：\n\n一级【0~1分】：按照公司标准完成休假，保证休假安全和休假质量。（底线原则）\n\n二级【1~2分】：净心自由地投入休假，非常轻松悠闲地享受休假。\n\n三级【2~3分】：具备较强的休假规划能力，培养新的兴趣爱好、技能，或对生活、生命有新的体验和感悟。\n\n四级【3~4分】：给周围人分享休假观念，带动更多人形成休假习惯，充分享受生命。\n\n五级【4~5分】：休闲成为生命常态。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cbddb19f-e2a1-4a2b-81b5-64f10b691900/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A18Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc3660b242369bc3a974af54fa1957ab26f2dc43c19fa7d22ecb951c7879a48b0"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cbddb19f-e2a1-4a2b-81b5-64f10b691900/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2F7d3cf2450ca5a498692d07c44fca2590456c3bc084f9649627c52ebe089bee97"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//cbddb19f-e2a1-4a2b-81b5-64f10b691900/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A17%3A19Z%2F-1%2F%2F0be1e57c219505ada8648d6047b229d6d87174a9978cc5ad6dca2dc5aabfc0de"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
